Diagram: two input files on the left — a Terraform/OpenTofu .tf and a Kubernetes
pod.yaml — both flow into a scanner box "Checkov / trivy config" (center) that
checks against a policy library (CIS benchmarks, provider best practices) and
emits a report (right) listing PASSED/FAILED checks. Prominent note: "static
analysis only — nothing is deployed, no cloud credentials". Flat style. max-width 860px.
